reference[35]: "  [--context NAME] [--file PATH (required for compose)] [--stale 15m] [--protect-live-owner] [--full] [--axi | --json]","dibs adopt <kind|k3d|compose> <handle> --pending ID [--file PATH] [--axi | --json]",Explicitly lease an existing resource. Existence must be verified and no lease,may already own it. Captures cleanup configuration; does not recreate resources.,Owner and positive TTL are required. Release/sweep keep their preview defaults.,"--key K: a retry with the same key and request returns status already_done.","--protect-live-owner: sweep reclaims only on proven owner death; requires the",DIBS_LIVE_OWNER_PROTECTION=1 environment variable or user config opt-in.,"--pending ID registers a resource the caller created for a pending lease (see","dibs create --pending); owner, TTL and context come from that lease. A retry","returns status already_done. Statuses: adopted, bound, already_done.","Examples:","  dibs adopt kind my-lab --owner pid:1234 --ttl 1h","  dibs adopt compose my-stack --file compose.yaml --owner pid:1234 --ttl 2h","  dibs adopt kind lab-7 --pending <id>","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Contract 1 (reconcile, reclaim, explain, extend, release, and --pending/--key):","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refusal, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, resource_unknown, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown,","expired, owner_dead, job_deadline. Extend success is renewed or reattached.","Exit 1 is only for operation failures. Output carries contract: 1.",See docs/consumer-contract.md.,"","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs adopt <kind|k3d|compose> <name> --owner KIND:ID --ttl D [--key K]"
